 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Lovely. Small blanket, box of your old sandwiches, and each bringer toasting cracker would make it feel special. Sure, I'd be happy to. Which one is it, and where is it located? Since you' moving it into the back yard, now is also a good time to clean it out. A sharp knife and a few strong partners do the trick. Sure, we can queue up a puzzle or board game while we work. Composter love to see you without a mountain of old food scraps on top. Of course, he wants to take his friend too, and sometimes little ones wander off. Would you rather move the bin in morning or after dinner?",
